  "name": "ara-wwtp-2019-2025",
  "title": "Wastewater treatment plants of Switzerland: catchments, plant locations and discharge points, 2019 to 2025",
  "description": "Yearly spatial datasets of Swiss wastewater treatment plants (ARA/WWTP) for 2019 to 2025. Each year has three layers: catchment polygons (EZG), plant location points, and discharge point locations. Built at Eawag by updating the ARA_2014 dataset from geodienste.ch, the VSA database, and cantonal and municipal sources. Not an official federal product; collecting cantonal wastewater data is the responsibility of the FOEN, whose collection has not been updated consistently since 2014.",
